           Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


        The splitchat door is a chat door with two window where
        the user and the sysop can type at the same time and
        the door puts the input in the correct window.

        At the top of the windows is the name of the user
        and sysop. The sysop always types in the Upper window
        note that if you as sysop use did door a lot it is very
        confusing if you log in on a BBS and chat with the sysop
        because you suddenly have to look in the lower window.
        Just a little point to consider ;)

        You can use cursor keys in this door and it does
        wordwrap .. so it is useable just as a normal chatmode.


        Add something like the folowing to your menu
        to use the splitchat door.
        The "=" is the character you use to start the chatdoor
        and can be changed to your needs. The "=" character
        is specially chosen to symbolise the two windows
        of the splitchatter .. together with a "-" for the 
        linechatter they are easy to remember.



Cmd "=" , 0-255
   CliDoor  "doors:chatdoor/SplitChat ~50 "
EndCmd


        Or something like this is you only want the sysop to
        be able to start the Chatdoor.



Cmd "=" , S , 0-255
   CliDoor  "doors:chatdoor/SplitChat ~50 "
EndCmd



